  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Technical assistance to support implementation and use of Economic Partnership Agreements. is a component of UK Trade Partnerships Programme (UKTP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;6,566,364. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Regional trade agreements (RTAs), Business policy and administration, Trade policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
